This product is the reference implementation of the cøntextTrust seal
(canonical normalization, BLAKE3 content hashing, composite hash with domain
binding, Ed25519 signatures and verification), together with its normative
specification (SPEC.md). Everything in this package — src/, dist/, SPEC.md
and the conformance suite — is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See the LICENSE file.

Runtime third-party dependencies (each under its own license):
- @noble/ed25519 — MIT — (c) Paul Miller, https://paulmillr.com
- @noble/hashes — MIT — (c) Paul Miller, https://paulmillr.com

The on-chain smart contracts referenced by CONTRATOS.md are NOT contained in
this package. They are published and verified on Sourcify and Polygonscan;
their addresses and reproduction commands live in CONTRATOS.md.

An earlier NOTICE shipped with versions 1.2.0 through 1.4.2 of this package
described the Solidity contracts directory of a different repository, listing
third parties (OpenZeppelin, Chainlink, forge-std) that are not dependencies
of this library, and a scope note that did not apply here. Published tarballs
are immutable, so those copies remain as they are; this file is the corrected
statement, and it ships from the next release onward. Flagged by external
audit on 21/aug/2026.
